unicodeNormalization is a port of the Rust crate unicode-normalization
(https://github.com/unicode-rs/unicode-normalization), version 0.1.25, to
Meadow. Its tables and test cases are generated from that crate, and its
algorithms are translated from the crate's source. Some test cases come from
the Unicode Character Database's NormalizationTest.txt.

